Package: InSituDiff
Title: Map perturbations in single cell spatial transcriptomics
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Danaher", "Patrick", email = "pdanaher@nanostring.com", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2844-5883"))
Description: Designed for single-cell spatial transcriptomics data, such as is created by the CosMx platform. Computes a new data matrix of "perturbations" in cell neighborhoods x genes, and provides tools for useful analyses of those perturbations.
